            "body": "test failure is more interesting now, but still not reliable:\r\n\r\n```\r\nFAILED   ...ild/Xtest_xdg_plugin/test/functional/plugin/zip_spec.lua @ 442: nvim.zip reports an incorrect archive password\r\n/home/runner/work/neovim/neovim/test/testutil.lua:147: Pattern does not match.\r\nPattern:\r\nincorrect password\r\nActual:\r\nzip: unable to read secret.txt from /home/runner/work/neovim/neovim/build/Xtest_tmpdir_plugin/T1180.105 space%#/encrypted.zip: timed out waiting for unzip\r\nstack traceback:\r\n\t/home/runner/work/neovim/neovim/test/testutil.lua:147: in function 'matches'\r\n\t...ild/Xtest_xdg_plugin/test/functional/plugin/zip_spec.lua:459: in function <...ild/Xtest_xdg_plugin/test/functional/plugin/zip_spec.lua:442>\r\n```",
